# Rihal Aptitude scoring service env.
#
# SCORING_SERVICE_TOKEN (optional): when set, every POST /score must present
#   `Authorization: Bearer <token>` (constant-time compared). Unset = open
#   (acceptable behind a private network / for local dev). The Next app sends
#   this same value via its SCORING_SERVICE_TOKEN env var.
# SCORING_SERVICE_TOKEN=""
